    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Genre</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Mystery Visual Novel \u00d7 Folk Horror \u00d7 Psychological Thriller</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer 1995. You return to the secluded village of Iwao, surrounded by mountains, due to your grandfather's critical illness. An ancient shrine in the village is said to seal away the legendary yokai &quot;Tsuchigumo&quot;. As the annual &quot;Mushi Okuri Festival&quot; approaches, the ritual flames threaten to awaken a millennium-old curse...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ancient Rite Shrouded in Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When eerie echoes resound from the cave, every villager lowers their gaze&quot;<br>In the shrine's flickering torchlight, the maiden chants unspeakable prayers. Scattered archives, midnight bonfires of forbidden objects...<br>As the ritual draws near, you begin to realize\u2014<br>The fractures in your memory hold the key to tearing open the village's veil of darkness.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Genre</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Mystery Visual Novel \u00d7 Folk Horror \u00d7 Psychological Thriller</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer 1995. You return to the secluded village of Iwao, surrounded by mountains, due to your grandfather's critical illness. An ancient shrine in the village is said to seal away the legendary yokai &quot;Tsuchigumo&quot;. As the annual &quot;Mushi Okuri Festival&quot; approaches, the ritual flames threaten to awaken a millennium-old curse...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ancient Rite Shrouded in Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When eerie echoes resound from the cave, every villager lowers their gaze&quot;<br>In the shrine's flickering torchlight, the maiden chants unspeakable prayers. Scattered archives, midnight bonfires of forbidden objects...<br>As the ritual draws near, you begin to realize\u2014<br>The fractures in your memory hold the key to tearing open the village's veil of darkness.</p>",
    "short_description": "In the summer of 1990, you return to the secluded mountain village of Iwao as your grandfather falls critically ill. The village shrine is said to seal the yokai &quot;Tsuchigumo.&quot; As the &quot;Mushi Okuri Festival&quot; nears, its ritual flames may awaken a thousand-year-old curse\u2026",
